{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S04 对是否后悔、当初是否走对的追问略偏向离开决定本身的复盘，但没有取代尊严与归属之间的拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S05 把冲突部分转成了能不能允许自己回忆美好过去，弱化了尊严诉求与怀念之间的正面冲突。\",\n    \"S08 删除了记得自己曾被当作自己人、却不把这份温暖当作回头理由的明确区分，削弱了两股力量的交织。\",\n    \"S09 将担心回去后再次忍受委屈的顾虑删去，主要变成怀念旧生活还是需要陪伴的辨析，使尊严这一侧变弱。\",\n    \"S12 的可以把好坏都记着，弱于不逼自己非得选一边，因而没有那么明确地呈现两种情感并存、持续拉扯后的态度变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 更完整地呈现了不愿再忍受委屈、又怀念旧日亲近与归属的反复冲突，而且两者会相互触发、改变他对回去和继续生活的判断。Y 也保留了大部分情节，但部分段落转向回忆的自我许可和孤独陪伴需求，尊严与怀念之间的核心拉扯因此有所弱化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "92408d67-118a-41c0-be05-330a403cabdd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093750119864Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:38:05.712254+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "af037d5a178d31f9537077210b79ec4677659232f79be8ce9b76f609b1b84aa3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8